\[
\partial \mathcal{T}_i = \gamma_{i,1} \cup \gamma_{i,2} \cup \gamma_{i,3}.
\]



Define the cyclic gluing:


\[
\gamma_{1,1} \sim \gamma_{2,2}, \qquad
\gamma_{2,1} \sim \gamma_{3,2}, \qquad
\gamma_{3,1} \sim \gamma_{1,2}.
\]



The remaining arcs $\gamma_{i,3}$ are glued in a 3-cycle:


\[
\gamma_{1,3} \sim \gamma_{2,3} \sim \gamma_{3,3}.
\]



This produces a closed 3–space:


