\]


and the Kretschmann scalar is:


\[
K_{\mathrm{Riem}}
=
\frac{1}{3} \left( R^{(3)}(\mathcal{V}_1) \right)^2.
\]



\subsection*{E.6 Minimality}

No proper subcomplex of $\mathcal{V}_1$ is closed under the gluing
rules. Removing any cell leaves unmatched boundary arcs, violating the
closure condition.

Thus $\mathcal{V}_1$ is minimal.

\subsection*{E.7 Conclusion}

The object $\mathcal{V}_1$:
\begin{itemize}
